> Three Tough Levels

Medusa does not belong in the same category as the other two.  It is much 
less rewarding, and much less dangerous.

Standard procedure for Medusa's level:

If you aren't willing/prepared to face the Castle, go immediately back 
upstairs.  Do not return until you are ready for the Castle.

If you are willing/prepared to face the Castle, step away from the water, 
then dig down to the next level.  Optionally, if you desire the 
(possible) shield of reflection, find the stairs up, blind yourself, kill 
Medusa, smash the statue.  Either way, use digging to proceed downwards 
to the Castle.  The drama of battling titan/eels/water/etc can all be 
delayed until after the Castle, when the character will be far better 
equipped to handle it.





